{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、またまたチームく のみんなで\nにゃんのお家にお泊まりしに行きました。\n打ち上げ感がまったく感じない程\nゆったりまったりしていて\n楽しかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉美味しかったわ〜わ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先日、幕張にて握手会がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/01/8813237/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かりづらくてごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops:\nskirt:Bubbles"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/01/8813237/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"all-in-one:ISBIT"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールのそのさらに\n髪の毛をぐるんとしたバージョン。\n羊ヘアに近いと言った方が\nわかりやすいですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に夏らしくなった！と\nたくさんの方に言われました\n夏はまた夏のファッションの楽しみがある〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もたくさんの方が来て下さいました\n本当に握手楽しすぎて笑いすぎて\nほうれい線見えちゃいそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hikaさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ブログはどこで書いてるの？\n何分位かかるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→家とか移動中にちょこちょこ\n下書きして時間はかなりかかる\n(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こはくさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・じょしらくで一番印象に残っている台詞は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→・プペラポンパンペルマモス\n・クスクスプー\n・久々に会っても人間の屑ですぅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですかね〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Kazupapaさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・横浜の個握で\n「イメージカラーは黄色〜みんなでsay!」\nお願いしたらみり愛はやってくれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろん一緒にやりましょう(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"圭さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・手紙ってちゃんと届くのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→届いていますよ〜\n宛名さえ間違えていなければ...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やまやまさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は中華料理は好き？\nもし好きだったら一番好きな\n中華料理ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→エビチリ大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キロヒンさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・かき氷の片思い\nみり愛がどこ歌っているのか教えて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→♪こっちを見てくれない意地悪な人\n♪突然思い出すよ恋はわがまま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はここの2つのパートは\n伊織と2人で歌ってるんです\n何かと縁がありますな〜(^-^)/♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/01/8813237/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと好き、好き、好きっよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間TVで伊織とある事をやるよ〜♪\nお楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしー⊿学ランGさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・体育祭と文化祭どっち好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ん〜選べない〜(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも楽しいし、好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！\nまた質問お待ちしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/01/8813237/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりあんさー◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去と未来ならどちらに行きたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月、５月のお誕生日の\n書き漏れごめんなさい(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月8日 よっぴさん\n4月18日 フレッシュさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月11日 とんとんさん\n5月13日 STARさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月26日 kenさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の合間に川後さんと\nお洋服や展示会を見にぷらぷら\nしてたのですが、\nやはりお洋服は見てて飽きない。\nあれもこれも欲しくなってしまう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなお洋服を着たいですね\n古着、不思議な柄など大好きだけど\nいつも見て終わるのでそういうのにも\n挑戦していきたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/01/8813237/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅力のある目が好きです！\nだから川後さんの目はかなり好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},